WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.200
LedgerLink — synthetic demonstration.

00:04.200 --> 00:14.000
The operator reviews a connection to accounts software and tests it against the local synthetic source.

00:14.000 --> 00:24.500
The connection is verified. Seven datasets are queued for the selected accounting period.

00:24.500 --> 00:40.000
Extraction writes workbook outputs. Evidence and drill-down show input, output and rejected counts for each file.

00:40.000 --> 00:58.000
An overhead actuals workbook opens on the transaction listing for the period.

00:58.000 --> 01:16.000
Downloaded workbooks sit beside a retention-by-project sheet generated from the same extract.

01:16.000 --> 01:40.000
Project costs and income are reviewed in a reusable workbook, including summary and commitments tabs.

01:40.000 --> 01:49.300
The run leaves controlled workbook outputs ready for later cashflow and reporting views.
